<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Hire purchase: compound interest on the balance (INNODEMS)</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>A small business buys a {@item@} with a cash price of Ksh \( {@C0@} \). It pays a \( {@dp@}\% \) deposit. The dealer charges \( {@R0@}\% \) per annum <strong>compound</strong> interest on the balance for \( {@T0@} \) years, and the total owed is cleared in \( {@n0@} \) equal monthly instalments.</p>
<p>Give your answers to 2 decimal places where necessary.</p>
<p>(a) How much does the business owe on the balance after \( {@T0@} \) years of compound interest?</p>
<div>Amount owed \( = \) Ksh [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</div>
<p>(b) Find the hire purchase price.</p>
<div>Hire purchase price \( = \) Ksh [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div>
<p>(c) Find the monthly instalment.</p>
<div>Monthly instalment \( = \) Ksh [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt3]]</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Deposit \( = \frac{ {@dp@} }{100} \times {@C0@} = {@D0@} \), balance \( = {@B0@} \).</p>
<p><strong>(a)</strong> \( A = {@B0@}\left(1 + \frac{ {@R0@} }{100}\right)^{ {@T0@} } = {@B0@} \times ({@float(1 + R0/100)@})^{ {@T0@} } = {@r2(A0)@} \).</p>
<p><strong>(b)</strong> \( H = \text{deposit} + A = {@D0@} + {@r2(A0)@} = {@r2(H0)@} \).</p>
<p><strong>(c)</strong> \( \dfrac{ {@r2(A0)@} }{ {@n0@} } = {@r2(x0)@} \).</p>
<p>With simple interest instead, the balance would grow to only \( {@r2(w_simple)@} \): compound interest charges interest on the interest too.</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>3</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.1</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <idnumber/>
    <stackversion>
      <text>2025010100</text>
    </stackversion>
    <questionvariables>
      <text><![CDATA[r2(v) := if integerp(round(100*v)/100) then round(v) else float(round(100*v)/100);
item : rand(["delivery van", "boda boda fleet", "printing machine", "refrigerated truck"]);
C0 : rand([500000, 800000, 1200000, 1500000]);
dp : rand([20, 25, 40]);
R0 : rand([10, 12, 15]);
T0 : rand([2, 3]);
n0 : 12*T0;
D0 : C0*dp/100;
B0 : C0 - D0;
A0 : B0*(1 + R0/100)^T0;
H0 : D0 + A0;
x0 : A0/n0;
w_simple : B0*(1 + R0*T0/100);           /* simple interest */
w_full   : C0*(1 + R0/100)^T0;           /* compound on the full cash price */]]></text>
    </questionvariables>
